---
description: TravelIsrael UI primitives and feature components
globs: components/**
alwaysApply: false
---
# UI Primitives (shadcn + custom)
Button (primary, secondary, ghost, danger)
Card, Badge, Dialog, Tabs, Input, Select, Skeleton, Toast
LazyList (Intersection Observer, 20/page)
ImageGallery, StarRating, MapView (Leaflet)
StatusBadge, DifficultyBadge

# Feature Components
TripCard — image, name, tags, rating, stats
StationList — draggable stations (DnD)
StationPicker — modal with search, filter, lazy load
TripStats — computed duration, distance, difficulty, price
WizardStep — single wizard step
MatchScore — match percentage with explanation
AdminTable — responsive admin table
StatusTabs — drafts / pending / approved / rejected

# Layout
Header, Footer, MobileNav — RTL, mobile-first
DemoRoleSwitcher in header for demo auth

# UX Requirements
- dir="rtl" throughout
- Loading state for every async action
- Success/error toast in Hebrew
- Grid: 1 col mobile, 2 tablet, 3 desktop
